abstract: >-
  Paper-level replication materials for "A Second Opinion for the Portfolio:
  How a New Forecasting Model Changes Cross-Asset Allocation Decisions".
  The package reproduces Figures 1–5 and validates the principal reported
  numerical results from frozen derived research evidence.
